@PetCareHub.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5062

### Listar todas as clínicas
GET {{PetCareHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Clinicas
Accept: application/json

### Buscar clínica por ID
GET {{PetCareHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Clinicas/1
Accept: application/json

### Criar uma nova clínica
POST {{PetCareHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Clinicas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Clinica Teste DotNet",
  "cnpj": "99999999000199",
  "email": "teste@petcare.com",
  "telefone": "(11) 99999-9999",
  "endereco": "Rua Teste, 123"
}

### Listar pets com filtros
GET {{PetCareHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Pets?clinicaId=1&especie=CAO&ativo=true
Accept: application/json

### Resumo do dashboard de uma clínica
GET {{PetCareHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Dashboard/clinicas/1
Accept: application/json

### Alertas pendentes filtrados
GET {{PetCareHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/AlertasSaude?nivelAlerta=CRITICO&resolvido=false
Accept: application/json

###